$ whycant read /srv/app/config.yml

✗ alice (uid 1000) cannot read /srv/app/config.yml

  /                     drwxr-xr-x  root:root      ✓ traverse
  /srv                  drwxr-xr-x  root:root      ✓ traverse
  /srv/app              drwxr-x---  deploy:deploy  ✗ traverse   ← blocked here
  /srv/app/config.yml   ·           not evaluated

Why
  alice was added to group "deploy", which would allow this, but this login session started
  before that and does not have the group yet. Group changes only apply to new
  sessions and restarted services; log out and back in.

Fixes (safest first)
  1. Start a session with the new group (or simply log out and back in):
       newgrp deploy
  2. Grant traverse only to alice via ACL:
       sudo setfacl -m u:alice:x /srv/app
